Description: classic interactive fiction adventure
 Zork I: The Great Underground Empire is the first commercial installment of
 Infocom's classic Zork interactive-fiction trilogy. The player explores the
 Great Underground Empire by entering natural-language commands and solving
 puzzles.
 .
 This package contains the MIT-licensed upstream Z-machine version 3 story
 image and a launcher that runs it with the Frotz interpreter.
